# Line endings.
#
# Every text file here is stored with LF. Without this, extracting a zip
# on Windows over files that were uploaded through GitHub's web interface
# rewrites every line of eleven files, and a 109 line change arrives as a
# 5,500 line diff. Set once, on 22 Aug 2026, after that had happened.

* text=auto eol=lf

# The installer is the exception. cmd.exe is not reliable with an LF only
# batch file, and this is the file colleagues double click, so it keeps
# Windows endings.
Install_AVH_Extensions.bat text eol=crlf

# Never touched.
*.png binary
*.pyc binary
